**Done.** Spawned `hyp:graph-core-r11` (Graph Traversal and Query Primitives) under `idea:domain-graph-core`. All 10 existing hypotheses covered nodes, edges, identity, persistence, recursive bodies, directory walking, caching, backends, portability, and bootstrap. R11 fills the traversal API gap — BFS/DFS, path finding, reachability, ancestor/descendant closures, and lazy subgraph extraction — needed by chain-engine and renderers.
